"P1669805905" "Used Teleportation Device"
// DetailString :
"P1196915354" "The Tabula Scutum was missing, but this strange device was in its place. Perhaps it is what Arachnos used to remove the Tabula from the cave -- and Cimerora. You should bring the device to Daedalus in the hope of discovering where the thieves have gone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WarehouseLocation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2566660633" "Location of the Tabula Scutum"
// DetailString :
"P2722393852" "You've tracked the Arachnos thieves to an abandoned warehouse, deep the Rikti War Zone. You only hope you can get there before they ship the stolen artifact off to the Rogue Isles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RecoveredTablet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P918617283" "Tabula Scutum"
// DetailString :
"P905922873" "This stone tablet belongs back in Cimerora. You should return it to Daedalus as soon as you can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P487837293" "Stolen Power"
// DetailString :
"P2890347995" "It began when Daedalus asked you to investigate the theft of the Tabula Scutum, a valuable artifact, from a shrine in a nearby cave. You went to the cave and found it crawling with Arachnos agents and the artifact gone. You recovered a discharged teleportation device that the thieves used to transport themselves and their ill-gotten gains out of the area."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1834055634" "It began when Daedalus asked you to investigate the theft of the Tabula Scutum, a valuable artifact, from a shrine in a nearby cave. You went to the cave and found it crawling with Arachnos agents and the artifact gone. You recovered a discharged teleportation device that the thieves used to transport themselves and their ill-gotten gains to Founder's Falls.<br><br>You arrived just in time to defeat Ghost Widow and prevent her from shipping the artifact off to the Rogue Isles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - StolenPower1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P704781045" "Marble Token"
// tDetailString :
"P4161140430" "This token is a gift from Daedalus, a reminder of how you helped him by recovering the Tabula Scutum, a stolen artifact of great power, in an adventure you've come to call:<br><br><color deepskyblue>Stolen Power</color><br><br> You tracked Ghost Widow through time and prevented the Tabula from being sent to the Rogue Isles. Your service to Daedalus didn't stop there; you fought side-by-side with him to clear out the caves where the artifact's shrine was and then restored the Tabula to power.<br><br>Without your help, the Tabula would have been lost to Cimerora forever. Now Daedalus can once again draw upon this power source in his fight against the fell Nictus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1301408634" "Hail, {HeroName}! The guardians of the <color orange>Tabula Scutum</color> have gone silent and I fear that miscreants from the future have absconded with it. <color orange>Would you investigate this theft for me?</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2879194503" "Investigate the theft"
// SendOffString :
"P135369319" "<color orange>Please go to the Cavern of the Tabula and determine the fate of this tablet.</color> The Tabula provides me with the energy I need to construct the devices and craftings I use to aid in the protection of my beloved homeland. Without its aid, my craftings are sadly weakened.<br><br>I do not understand the ways of the dwellers from your time or I would attend to this matter myself.<br><br>I will be grateful for your assistance in this matter. There is no telling what trouble these thieves will cause with such a powerful source in their hands."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2888892593" "Investigate the Theft"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1472739758" "Have you recovered my Tabula yet?"
// TaskTitle :
"P3082579778" "<color deepskyblue>Stolen Power</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

