// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4030581470" "Keep your mouths shut about this operation. We can't afford to let Lord Recluse find out we've been freelancing for Ghost Widow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3424429007" "Ghost Widow paid us to take care of any loose ends. That means {HeroName}. Get {Hero.gender=Male him|her}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3864174396" "You're too late; Ghost Widow's already escaped with the prize."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2579925063" "Look, {HeroName}, I don't know why Ghost Widow wanted that thing, but it's gone now. <em>What say we both just walk away from this?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P913855103" "Even if you defeat me, your prize is halfway to the Rogue Islands by now."

