// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3483185531" "This Ghost Widow has used a teleportation device to remove herself and the Tabula Scutum to the future, to a place you call Founder's Falls. I have tracked her destination to a building there, where, for now, the Tabula rests. I fear she intends on removing the Tabula from beyond my reach. <color orange>Would you recover the Tabula for me?</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3457964882" "Find the thieves and recover the Tabula"
// SendOffString :
"P3627779702" "The Tabula is more important than I have let on, {HeroName}, for it allows me to directly commune with Hephaestus, the Divine Smith. It is a direct conduit to the god and in the wrong hands can create no end of trouble.<br><br>You are a puissant and able warrior. It is well within your powers to track the trail of this thief. Please, recover the Tabula and make this Ghost Widow -- and all who dare fight for her -- pay for their insult to Cimerora."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2946388386" "Recover the Tabula"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3269335345" "You must pry the Tabula from Ghost Widow's grasp."

