"P2539809088" "I have one final request for you, {HeroName}. <color orange>The Tabula Scutum must be returned to its proper resting place and its power restored.</color> I fear that with the artifact gone, my enemies have overrun the cave. I would ask your aid in defeating them and restoring the Tabula once and for all."
